# Build artifacts of the three sides of the oracle, and the fetched W3C suite.
#
# The root .gitignore covers node_modules/ and build/, but NOT a nested Rust
# target/ (git check-ignore -v packages/xml/oracle/rust/target/x finds no match),
# so it is named here. The W3C conformance suite is fetched by
# fetch-xmlconf.sh rather than vendored, following the mustache oracle's
# precedent of pinning a URL instead of a copy.
probe/packages/
probe/build/
rust/target/
xmlconf/
